    "detailed_description": "In man pit you play as a man that falls into a pit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight and fluid platforming controls, allowing for advanced maneuvering around obstacles<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels mixed with hand-crafted ones. Each run is different. <br></li><li> A man (that's you)<br></li><li> The Pit (which you, the man, fall into)<br></li><li> Friends! (You make them along the way. They are also all men. In the pit.)<br></li><li> Rocks with various writings on them left over by the other men also in the pit. Maybe they have something interesting to say?<br></li><li> Permadeath. Good luck reaching the surface lol</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In man pit you play as a man that falls into a pit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight and fluid platforming controls, allowing for advanced maneuvering around obstacles<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels mixed with hand-crafted ones. Each run is different. <br></li><li> A man (that's you)<br></li><li> The Pit (which you, the man, fall into)<br></li><li> Friends! (You make them along the way. They are also all men. In the pit.)<br></li><li> Rocks with various writings on them left over by the other men also in the pit. Maybe they have something interesting to say?<br></li><li> Permadeath. Good luck reaching the surface lol</li></ul>",
